{"title":"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/f/12fa44614c0c514290222b7ab5317272df05c948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f854a2af58f6797f5cda6ea029b7519597232e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{-1}(x) = bx+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"19\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> real, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/301ad92911ce86b0fd44419e09bdafb315d377af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ -2 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"386\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28Alcumus.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(Alcumus)\">Solution (Alcumus)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (Alcumus)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f728ee4dc8d81f98629606191bf0c60656b9a69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f^{-1}(x))=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"19\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe94c35f2f2548b5962a3c132e034ac5e280113c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(bx+a)+b=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />, which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da73b9fded47fc7fdf9830c586174179df020f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abx + a^2 +b = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />. This equation holds for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2fbad6d76459307b6f377b0007124f3c48e47a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a1424c8b938cbe73ca41d658f5259288d8b8b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4be30d74fa4d4eec130ce4c6bc1c88e57acba4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -a^2$\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />. Substituting into the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78fed10b7a7e08e2c85c0eb365f15cc759885edb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a7306393126b3850160a27bb79a2f3706605531a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a^3 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce67f0e5287f11dc65e3f81673742d580064d9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, and<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f37fa6edb13824dc4671c96b8445db70e5f3eb7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=-x-1.\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" />Likewise<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/1815a3c4b4cb8e4706593728a29e2cac78334fa3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f^{-1}(x)=-x-1.\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"19\" />These are inverses to one another since<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9a2ba6c9e59db581ac637bb4fab9f38894cbea0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(f^{-1}(x))=-(-x-1)-1=x+1-1=x.\\]\" width=\"353\" height=\"19\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/f/b3f20bd3fb5d755851e3caac26d81ad24804ac15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f^{-1}(f(x))=-(-x-1)-1=x+1-1=x.\\]\" width=\"353\" height=\"19\" />Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d9503272c08b4658e15a40983c7e639828ee0b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ -2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"142\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>note: you could just find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/35936109f5553f9d3a884aba528e07ec8408c187.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> and add, getting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B\">2004 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems